            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Two tails reset the game, so ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "p=\\frac12+\\frac14p",
                "display": false
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ".",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "Let $p$ be the probability that Alice eventually wins. She wins immediately with probability $\\frac12$. If both players toss tails, with probability $\\frac12\\times\\frac12$, the game resets and her winning probability is again $p$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}p&=\\frac12+\\frac12\\times\\frac12\\times p\\\\p&=\\frac12+\\frac14p\\\\4p&=2+p\\\\3p&=2\\\\p&=\\frac23\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
